      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rounds: 8. Work the oval flat in a contrast colour. Sew closed around the edges, leaving one long edge open for a 3D hinge effect if preferred."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Chain 6. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 3 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 3 ch, 2 sc in last ch (14 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (20 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 3: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (26 st)"
          }
        ]
